<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text">GRPO-<math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span> : Credit Assignment improves LLM Reasoning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
