<div id="algorithm2.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm2.4.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm2.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{A}_{\text{NAE}}\leftarrow\max(A_{\text{NAE}},-0.1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext mathsize="0.900em">NAE</mtext></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">NAE</mtext></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{A}_{\text{NAE}}\leftarrow\max(A_{\text{NAE}},-0.1)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm2.4.3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm2.4.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm2.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{coef}_{1}\leftarrow\exp(\log\pi^{\theta}_{x^{i}_{t}}-\log\pi^{old}_{x^{i}_{t}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">coef</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">π</mi><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">π</mi><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{coef}_{1}\leftarrow\exp(\log\pi^{\theta}_{x^{i}_{t}}-\log\pi^{old}_{x^{i}_{t}})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm2.4.4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm2.4.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm2.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{coef}_{2}\leftarrow\text{clamp}(\mathrm{coef}_{1},\ 1\pm\epsilon_{clip})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">coef</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext mathsize="0.900em">clamp</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">coef</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em"> 1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">±</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">ϵ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{coef}_{2}\leftarrow\text{clamp}(\mathrm{coef}_{1},\ 1\pm\epsilon_{clip})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm2.4.5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm2.4.6.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm2.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{t}\leftarrow\sum_{l=0}^{t}(\gamma\lambda)^{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">w</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.111em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" rspace="0em" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{t}\leftarrow\sum_{l=0}^{t}(\gamma\lambda)^{l}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm2.4.6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm2.4.7.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A^{\pi_{\theta}}_{x^{i}_{r}}\leftarrow-\min(\mathrm{coef}_{1},\mathrm{coef}_{2})\hat{A}_{\text{NAE}}(x_{r}^{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msubsup><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">π</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></msub></msubsup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">coef</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">coef</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">^</mo></mover><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">NAE</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msubsup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A^{\pi_{\theta}}_{x^{i}_{r}}\leftarrow-\min(\mathrm{coef}_{1},\mathrm{coef}_{2})\hat{A}_{\text{NAE}}(x_{r}^{i})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm2.4.7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> ;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm2.4.8.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm2.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon^{w}_{x^{i}_{r}}\leftarrow w\ @\ (1+\sigma(\log\pi^{\theta}_{x^{i}_{r}}-1))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">ϵ</mi><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">w</mi></msubsup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">w</mi><mo lspace="0.460em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">@</mi><mo lspace="0.460em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">π</mi><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon^{w}_{x^{i}_{r}}\leftarrow w\ @\ (1+\sigma(\log\pi^{\theta}_{x^{i}_{r}}-1))</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm2.4.8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm2.4.9.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm2.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\text{GRPO-$\lambda$}}\leftarrow\epsilon^{w}_{x^{i}_{r}}A^{\pi_{\theta}}_{x^{i}_{r}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">GRPO-</mtext><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.630em">λ</mi></mrow></msub><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">ϵ</mi><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">w</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><msubsup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">x</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msubsup><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">π</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></msub></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\text{GRPO-$\lambda$}}\leftarrow\epsilon^{w}_{x^{i}_{r}}A^{\pi_{\theta}}_{x^{i}_{r}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm2.4.9.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">;</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm2.4.10.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algorithm2.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\text{GRPO-$\lambda$}}\leftarrow\ell_{\text{GRPO-$\lambda$}}+\beta\cdot\ell_{KL}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mrow><mtext mathsize="0.900em">GRPO-</mtext><mi mathsize="0.630em">λ</mi></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mrow><mtext mathsize="0.900em">GRPO-</mtext><mi mathsize="0.630em">λ</mi></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">β</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\text{GRPO-$\lambda$}}\leftarrow\ell_{\text{GRPO-$\lambda$}}+\beta\cdot\ell_{KL}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm2.4.10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.11" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<section id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Upper bound <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta V_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta V_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The estimation of <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta^{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>δ</mi><mi>V</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta^{V}</annotation></semantics></math> by <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1. ‣ 3 GRPO-𝜆 for rapid reward propagation ‣ GRPO-𝜆 : Credit Assignment improves LLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Theorem 1</span></a> requires an upper bound for <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta V_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta V_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. In <a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1. ‣ 3.1 Bounding the normalized advantage estimation bias ‣ 3 GRPO-𝜆 for rapid reward propagation ‣ GRPO-𝜆 : Credit Assignment improves LLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Lemma 1</span></a> we derive the upper bound to be the probability of generating an EOS-token. Our implementation does not use this upper bound in its advantage.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Trace weights</h4>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Trace matrix is a non-learnable precomputed lower-triangular matrix with 1s on the leading diagonal. The two variants of <span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">GRPO-<math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span> uses <em id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">recent</em> and <em id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">both</em> styles for the trace-weights, which is computed with <span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">get_trace()</span>. The <span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">get_trace()</span> method takes in as arguments: (<math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>, max_length, style: both, recent). For the choice <span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">both</span>, the trace matrix is estimated as:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.EGx10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E17"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{trace}^{both}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{if }\text{rows}=\text{cols}\\
\max\left(\max\left(\epsilon,\ (\gamma\lambda)^{n-\text{cols}}\right),\ (\gamma\lambda)^{\text{cols}}\right),&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mtext>trace</mtext><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mtext>rows</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext>cols</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>cols</mtext></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mtext>cols</mtext></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{trace}^{both}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{if }\text{rows}=\text{cols}\\
\max\left(\max\left(\epsilon,\ (\gamma\lambda)^{n-\text{cols}}\right),\ (\gamma\lambda)^{\text{cols}}\right),&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">for <span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">recent</span>:</p>
<table id="A1.EGx11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E18"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{trace}^{recent}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{if }\text{rows}=\text{cols}\\
\max\left(\epsilon,\ (\gamma\lambda)^{\max(\text{cols})-\text{cols}}\right),&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>trace</mtext><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mtext>rows</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mtext>cols</mtext></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>cols</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mtext>cols</mtext></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{trace}^{recent}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{if }\text{rows}=\text{cols}\\
\max\left(\epsilon,\ (\gamma\lambda)^{\max(\text{cols})-\text{cols}}\right),&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Usage of weight style <span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">both</span> as an alternate to <span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">recent</span>, and the strong training and benchmark performance that this provides is encouraging and serves as a precursor to explore alternate weighting styles that are domain or data dependent.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Hyperparameters</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section provides a complete overview of all hyperparameters used to run our experiments. Our codebase is based on <a href="https://github.com/huggingface/open-r1/tree/29015d7e4c111149592c4ca30ed23daa13c7fd45" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Huggingface OpenR1</a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For evaluation, we use <a href="https://github.com/sail-sg/understand-r1-zero" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">the understanding-r1-zero codebase</a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="A2.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Hyperparameter configurations used for <span id="A2.T2.5.1" class="ltx_text">GRPO-<math id="A2.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span> .</span></figcaption>
